<title>UK: LSE appoints UBS's Sants to board.</title>
<headline>LSE appoints UBS's Sants to board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Stock Exchange (LSE) said on Thursday that it has appointed Hector Sants, vice chairman of UBS Ltd, to the board of the LSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
